  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup butter",
    "1 cup cola-flavored carbonated beverage",
    "3 tablespoons unsweetened cocoa powder",
    "1.5 cups miniature marshmallows",
    "0.5 cup buttermilk",
    "2 large eggs",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "6 tablespoons cola-flavored carbonated beverage",
    "2 tablespoons unsweetened cocoa powder",
    "4 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "1 cup chopped pecans"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dUtZpoqJ_2RAu8NgNT9YYiUj0EA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7502-coco-cola-cake-ii-VAT-step-01-4444648645154689ae047a4bdbb1bd14.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7502/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the cola cake: Combine flour and sugar in a mixing bowl. Place butter, cola soft drink, and cocoa in a saucepan over medium heat; bring to a boil. Pour over flour mixture; mix well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mICdzpu3mu5qg5y_3BZ2GxA7zSA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7502-coco-cola-cake-ii-VAT-step-02-658343d9ee5a4cbdbc20ebfaef00d187.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7502/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in marshmallows, buttermilk, eggs, baking soda, and vanilla until well combined; pour cake batter into prepared dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5G9uKweBC0MR6yS3RXKqbMiYFOY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7502-coco-cola-cake-ii-VAT-step-03-5380c84c6b9d406196db8edca6b0b860.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7502/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake cake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted in the center comes out clean, about 40 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xYNgpcjhujbATIeKArrqP4Sljw0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7502-coco-cola-cake-ii-VAT-step-04-1496fc0f01254825b45bead911f2ae7e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7502/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the cola frosting: Combine butter, cola soft drink, and cocoa in a saucepan; bring to a boil. Pour over confectioners' sugar in a large bowl; mix well. Stir in chopped nuts.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dRBmbA5cRqPoDnEbeH8LIxnQg8A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7502-coco-cola-cake-ii-VAT-step-05-175d1fe1ef514f928e17a3de5bbb6928.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7502/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread cola frosting over hot cake.",
